You can learn minor skills later.

125
00:12:09.854 --> 00:12:11.521
CUSTOMER SATISFACTION MANUAL

126
00:12:11.648 --> 00:12:14.941
For a few days, just sit next to her,
see how things work

127
00:12:15.068 --> 00:12:17.444
