128
00:12:18.112 --> 00:12:19.738
Put those back on.
Let's do this!

129
00:12:19.864 --> 00:12:21.448
Let's do this!

130
00:12:22.116 --> 00:12:27.120
Yes, sir, may I ask
the reason for your call?

131
00:12:27.247 --> 00:12:30.040
Fuck, I already told
