133
00:12:37.090 --> 00:12:38.465
Our process requires...

134
00:12:38.591 --> 00:12:44.596
Jeonnam Yeosu-Si
Dolsan-eup Odo-ri 97-11.

135
00:12:44.722 --> 00:12:48.183
Jeonnam Yeosu-Si
Dolsan-eup Odo-ri...

136
00:12:48.309 --> 00:12:49.768
