of normal targets.

226
00:19:12.068 --> 00:19:15.278
Not that trainees
can't make them.

227
00:19:16.197 --> 00:19:19.616
But you're not there yet.
You're still a trainee.

228
00:19:27.291 --> 00:19:28.541
How do I look?

229
00:19:29.251 --> 00:19:30.668
Let's buy that too.

230
00:19:30.795 --> 00:19:33.463
This coral pink
looks good on you.

231
